  "description": "Blackbox-exporter health probe for arogyam-dashboard, across both aa-stg and aa-prod. The original, always-on health check for this service. The unified \"Arogyam Platform\" dashboard's own arogyam-dashboard probe tiles cover the same probe_success / probe_duration_seconds signals split per environment; this dashboard also plots the raw HTTP status code the probe received, which the unified one doesn't, so it's the one to check for the actual status code.",
