        "text": {
          "content": "# arogyam-dashboard — external health probe\n\nThree blackbox-exporter checks against arogyam-dashboard, covering both **aa-stg** and **aa-prod** in the same chart (check each line's legend for which pod/environment it is). This is the original, standalone health check for this service — the unified **Arogyam Platform** dashboard's \"arogyam-dashboard internal health probe\" section covers the same `probe_success` / `probe_duration_seconds` signals (split per environment there); this dashboard also plots the raw `probe_http_status_code`, which the unified one doesn't, so it's the one to check for the actual status code the probe received.\n\n**Watch for:** probe success dropping from 1 to 0 (app unreachable), response time climbing, or a status code other than 200.",
